# {{APP_NAME}} — AI Coding Instructions

This is a Tauri v2 desktop application with a Rust backend and React 19 + TypeScript frontend.
Generated by [Crabyard](https://crabyard.dev).

---

## Architecture

```
Frontend (React 19 + TypeScript + Vite)
  ↕ IPC bridge via tauri invoke()
Backend (Rust + Tauri v2)
  ↕ Native OS APIs, filesystem, HTTP, persistent storage
```

The frontend runs in a webview. The backend is a native Rust process. Communication happens through Tauri's `invoke()` IPC mechanism — the frontend calls named Rust commands that return serialized results.

---

## Project Structure

```
src/                          # React frontend
├── App.tsx                   # Root component — auth guard + layout
├── main.tsx                  # React entry point
├── index.css                 # Tailwind CSS + theme variables
├── vite-env.d.ts             # Vite + VITE_APP_NAME env type
├── components/
│   ├── DashboardView.tsx     # Main app screen (START HERE for new features)
│   ├── LoginView.tsx         # Auth login UI
│   ├── TitleBar.tsx          # Custom window chrome (macOS/Windows/Linux)
│   ├── UpdateBanner.tsx      # Auto-update notification banner
│   └── ui/                   # UI component primitives (Button, Card, Input, Dialog, ...)
├── hooks/
│   ├── useAuth.ts            # Auth state + login/logout/restore
│   ├── useSettings.ts        # Settings load/save + folder picker
│   └── useUpdater.ts         # App auto-update check/install
├── store/
│   └── appStore.ts           # Zustand global state (auth + settings)
└── lib/
    ├── tauri.ts              # Typed invoke() wrappers for ALL Rust commands
    ├── types.ts              # TypeScript interfaces (mirrors Rust models)
    ├── platform.ts           # OS detection: "macos" | "windows" | "linux"
    └── utils.ts              # cn() — Tailwind class merging helper

src-tauri/                    # Rust backend
├── src/
│   ├── lib.rs                # App init, plugin registration, command handler list
│   ├── main.rs               # Entry point (windows_subsystem = "windows" on release)
│   ├── error.rs              # AppError enum (thiserror) + Serialize for IPC
│   ├── state.rs              # AppState struct — shared mutable state (Mutex)
│   ├── auth/                 # Auth module (token store, validation, flow impl)
│   ├── commands/             # Tauri IPC command handlers
│   │   ├── auth.rs           # login, poll_auth, logout, get_auth_status, restore_auth
│   │   └── settings.rs       # get_settings, set_settings, select_workspace_folder
│   └── models/               # Serde types shared between Rust ↔ TypeScript
│       ├── auth.rs           # AuthStatus, DeviceCodeResponse
│       └── settings.rs       # AppSettings
├── Cargo.toml                # Rust dependencies
├── tauri.conf.json           # Tauri config (window size, bundle, plugins, build commands)
└── capabilities/
    └── default.json          # Permission grants for Tauri plugins
```

