## UI Components

UI primitives live in `src/components/ui/`. Available components: Button, Card, Input, Dialog, Badge, Separator, Switch, Tooltip, Avatar, ScrollArea, DropdownMenu.

### Adding more shadcn components

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add [component-name]
```

### Adding tesign components

```bash
npx @slideup/design add [component-name]
npx @slideup/design list          # see all available
npx @slideup/design diff          # check for updates
```

### Adding DaisyUI components

DaisyUI components are CSS-class-based. Use Tailwind classes directly:
```tsx
<button className="btn btn-primary">Click me</button>
<div className="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">...</div>
```

See https://daisyui.com/components/ for the full component reference.

